#: .\apps\news_events\admin.py:602
msgid ""
"<strong>Image Requirements:</strong><br>• Recommended size: 800x1200px or "
"larger<br>• Format: JPG or PNG<br>• The image will be displayed in a "
"scrollable modal popup<br>• Alt text is important for accessibility"
msgstr ""

#: .\apps\news_events\admin.py:613
